cookiecutter-uv-core  0.9.0  2026-11-16  Alex Key  <alexk3y@gmail.com>

* Initial release: a Cookiecutter template for Python services managed with uv.

* The generated project is a typed package in the src layout with layered
  configuration through Pydantic, structured logging through structlog, asynchronous
  SQLAlchemy access to PostgreSQL, and a Click command-line interface.

* A Makefile drives dependency management, code quality checks, tests, and Docker
  images for x86_64 and ARM64.

* Instructions and skills for the Claude Code and OpenAI Codex coding agents.
